OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FA man accused of being an organised
OL,8,Fcrime boss has woken up in an Irish
OL,9,Fjail after several years of living in
OL,10,FDubai.
OL,12,FDaniel Kinahan, 49, was flown to
OL,13,FIreland on an Irish Government jet on
OL,14,FSunday, and immediately taken by high-
OL,15,Fspeed Garda escort to court in Dublin,
OL,16,Fwhere he was charged with directing
OL,17,Fthe activities of a criminal
OL,18,Forganisation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FWith no legal representation, the
OL,8,FDublin man was remanded into custody
OL,9,Fand transferred to the maximum-
OL,10,Fsecurity Portlaoise Prison in the
OL,11,FIrish midlands.
OL,13,FHe was likely to have been placed on A
OL,14,Fwing, with some of the most high-
OL,15,Fprofile residents and others facing
OL,16,Ftrial at the Special Criminal Court.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FMr Kinahan, alleged to be a leader of
OL,8,Fthe Kinahan organised crime group, was
OL,9,Farrested in the United Arab Emirates
OL,10,Fon April 15 on foot of an arrest
OL,11,Fwarrant issued by the Irish courts.
OL,13,FThis was carried out in accordance
OL,14,Fwith a bilateral agreement on
OL,15,Fextradition between Ireland and the
OL,16,FUAE.
OL,18,FAfter the plane left Dubai on Sunday,
OL,19,Fthe justice ministers for Ireland and
OL,20,Fthe UAE welcomed the extradition in a
OL,21,Fjoint statement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FJim O'Callaghan and Abdullah bin
OL,8,FSultan bin Awad Al Nuaimi said the
OL,9,FIrish national being extradited was
OL,10,F"regarded as one of the most high-
OL,11,Fprofile individuals sought for
OL,12,Fprosecution in connection with
OL,13,Ftransnational organised crime".
OL,15,FThey confirmed the extradition after a
OL,16,Fformal request submitted by Irish
OL,17,Fauthorities, and the final decision
OL,18,Fwas issued after a judgment by the
OL,19,FDubai Court of Cassation, in
OL,20,Faccordance with the extradition treaty
OL,21,Fbetween the two countries.
OL,26,@rD@AOUuD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FThe two ministers added that the final
OL,8,Fextradition decision "reflects the
OL,9,Fsteadfast commitment of both countries
OL,10,Fto the rule of law and reinforces
OL,11,Finternational judicial co-operation".
OL,13,FCrowds gathered outside both the
OL,14,FCasement Aerodrome in Baldonnel on the
OL,15,Foutskirts of Dublin on Sunday for the
OL,16,Flanding of the plane, and the Special
OL,17,FCriminal Court, to try to get a
OL,18,Fglimpse of Mr Kinahan.
OL,26,@pD@VOUsD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FThey watched two separate high speed
OL,8,Fconvoys pass by, in an additional
OL,9,Fprecaution, to transport the man
OL,10,Fbelieved to have been the target of a
OL,11,Fgun attack at a boxing weigh-in in
OL,12,FDublin in 2016.
OL,14,FInside the court room, the dock was
OL,15,Fchecked by gardai before Mr Kinahan
OL,16,Fappeared, alongside several other
OL,17,Fgardai, for a hearing which lasted
OL,18,Fabout 14 minutes.
OL,26,@wD@QrtyD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FAt the judge-led hearing, Judge Fiona
OL,8,FLydon, Judge Patrick McGrath and Ms
OL,9,FJustice Sarah Berkeley sat in the
OL,10,Fcourt which tries terrorism and
OL,11,Forganised crime cases.
OL,13,FMr Kinahan told the court he had been
OL,14,Fisolated from Friday afternoon, adding
OL,15,Fthat he believed a family member would
OL,16,Fhave contacted a legal representative
OL,17,Fon his behalf, and he was happy to
OL,18,Fproceed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FHe did not react after being charged
OL,8,Fwith directing the activities of a
OL,9,Fcriminal organisation between October
OL,10,F18 2015 and April 6 2017.
OL,12,FDetective Sergeant Colin Davidson told
OL,13,Fthe court that he had arrested Mr
OL,14,FKinahan on foot of an arrest warrant
OL,15,Fissued by the Irish courts at Casement
OL,16,FAerodrome in Baldonnel at 6.49pm that
OL,17,Fday.
OL,19,FHe said he ensured that the accused
OL,20,Funderstood the charge.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786447091
OL,3,CMan accused of being crime boss wakes
OL,4,Cup in Irish prison after a life in
OL,5,CDubai
OL,7,FJudge McGrath told Mr Kinahan when the
OL,8,Fcase would next be heard, and
OL,9,Fexplained to him that because of the
OL,10,Fcharge an application for bail would
OL,11,Fhave to be made to the High Court.
OL,13,FMr Kinahan said: "I understand. I
OL,14,Fthink we know I won't be getting bail,
OL,15,Fbut thank you."
OL,17,FHe will next appear in court on
OL,18,FOctober 5, and was told that he has
OL,19,Fthe option of either attending in
OL,20,Fperson or appearing via video link.
OL,26,@uD@ROUwD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
